What the license covers
-----------------------
All of GuildLens's own code: Core/, Locales/, Sources/ and UI/.

Data
----
GuildLens ships no data of its own and sends nothing anywhere. It shows only what the game client itself tells the
player about their guild (the guild roster).

Third-party components
----------------------
Libs/ contains libraries of the Ace3 project (https://www.wowace.com/projects/ace3): LibStub, CallbackHandler-1.0,
AceGUI-3.0 and AceConfig-3.0, copyright the Ace3 Development Team and their authors, released under their own
BSD-style license, which allows them to be shipped with this program. They draw the options window.

